// Scottish Fold on all fours, for the skinned mesh: a round teddy bear of a
// cat with a flat-topped head and little ears folded forward, a thick tail
// wrapped round its side. The body lies along z (+z is forward), the head
// sits on the front of the chest, each leg has its own bone. Same face and
// coats as model.ron, the head at 80%.
// The tail comes from gen_tail.py: change it there and paste the output
// back in (python3 gen_tail.py | python3 ../splice.py quad.ron).
(
    species: "fold",
    slots: ["fur", "light", "stripe", "eye", "ink", "nose", "blush"],
